{
  "_comment": "Copy to rtg-dev-world.json (gitignored). Unity loads it in Play (Editor: apps/unity-poc/rtg-dev-world.json; device build: Assets/StreamingAssets/rtg-dev-world.json). API bases: Editor local = http://localhost:3001/api (pnpm dev); public mobile = https://8082ventures.com/rtg_api/api; same-Wi‑Fi LAN optional = http://192.168.x.x:3001/api; temporary public local API = HTTPS URL from pnpm dev:tunnel. Create a world: curl -X POST https://8082ventures.com/rtg_api/api/worlds -H 'Content-Type: application/json' -d '{\"name\":\"Douglas Survey\",\"spawnLat\":42.7597,\"spawnLng\":-105.3822,\"pin\":\"1234\"}'.",
  "apiBaseUrl": "https://8082ventures.com/rtg_api/api",
  "worldId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "empireId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "accessCode": "XXXXXX",
  "slug": "your-world-slug"
}
